# Public deploy repo — track ONLY what Netlify needs to serve the site,
# plus the build inputs that produce it.
# Internal workstation docs (CLAUDE.md, MEMORY.md, handoffs, version logs,
# deploy notes) stay local and out of the public GitHub repo.

/*
!/.gitignore
!/netlify.toml
!/battle-adviser-web/

/battle-adviser-web/*
!/battle-adviser-web/index.html

# Build inputs: the web-only delta layered onto each Cowork artifact.
# Outside the Netlify publish root, so never served — but versioned, because
# the coffee tab has no other source of truth.
!/build-web.mjs
!/_web-parts/
